ntdll: Implement the AVL generic table functions used by the AppX tools.

makeappx.exe, appxpackaging.dll, and appxsip.dll keep options and package
parts in RTL_AVL_TABLEs. Elements follow the Windows layout (an
RTL_BALANCED_LINKS header followed by the caller's data) and the tree stays
ordered; it is not rebalanced. RtlInsertElementGenericTableAvl returns the
element and writes a BOOLEAN, as on Windows.

